text I leave the store, clutching a bag stuffed with bread.
text @[Tomoya]
text (I guess I'll start with this house here...)
text After ringing the bell, I open the door slightly and yell inside.
text @[Tomoya]
text Heeeyo, Furukawa Bread's here for a delivery!
sound QZR.aac
text @[Voice]
text Comiiing.
text I'm greeted by the energetic voice of a housewife.
sound QZS.aac
text @[Housewife]
text Coming, coming, coming...!
text She comes up to me.
sound QZT.aac
text @[Housewife]
text There, please come in.
text I open the door wide and enter.
sound QZU.aac
text @[Housewife]
text My, it's Okazaki-kun. It's been a while.
text In front of me was the face of a regular customer I got well acquainted with during the time I worked at Furukawa Bread.
text @[Tomoya]
text Hello. So you lived here? I never knew.
sound QZV.aac
text @[Housewife]
text Well, I'm surprised too.
sound QZW.aac
text @[Housewife]
text So did you go back to work there full-time?
text @[Tomoya]
text No, just for today and tomorrow.
text @[Tomoya]
text With the old man not being in the house right now and all.
sound QZX.aac
text @[Housewife]
text My, that sounds bad. Did something happen?
text @[Tomoya]
text Some old friends of his are making a new troupe, so he's going all the way to Kyushu to see them.
sound QZY.aac
text @[Housewife]
text Huh... He never seemed like the type to take off work for something like that.
sound QZZ.aac
text @[Housewife]
text I'll bet it's because you're here, Okazaki-kun.
text @[Tomoya]
text Of course not.
text @[Tomoya]
text We actually had to go through a great deal just to persuade him to go.
sound R00.aac
text @[Housewife]
text I bet you did.
text @[Tomoya]
text Although I did end up having to work on my day off because of all this...
sound R01.aac
text @[Housewife]
text You're young, so you'll be fine.
text @[Tomoya]
text I sure hope so.
text @[Tomoya]
text Well, here. Here's the usual.
text I hand over the vinyl bag I've been carrying.
sound R02.aac
text @[Housewife]
text Thanks for everything, by the way.
sound R03.aac
text @[Housewife]
text Akio-san is always such a big help.
sound R04.aac
text @[Housewife]
text The bath he fixed the other day is working even better than before. He really saved me a lot of trouble.
text @[Tomoya]
text Bath?
sound R05.aac
text @[Housewife]
text Yes. Just the other day my bath broke down, and so when I was preparing to go to the bathhouse, Akio-san came to deliver me bread, and...
sound R06.aac
text @[Housewife]
text then when I told him the story, he came inside, asking me to show him.
sound R07.aac
text @[Housewife]
text I told him I'd have someone take care of it the day after and so he shouldn't bother himself, but he still went and fixed it. It took him almost two hours. His clothes were all stained black when he finished.
text @[Tomoya]
text Wow...
sound R08.aac
text @[Housewife]
text Sounds like something he'd do, though, right?
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah, kinda...
