text @[Tomoya]
text Something dirty.
sound R0Y.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Ah... something dirty...?
sound R0Z.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Aah... what should I do...?
sound R10.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text ...
sound R11.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text I mean... we're at my parents' right now, and...
text @[Tomoya]
text Just kidding.
sound R12.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Eh?
text @[Tomoya]
text I just wondered how you'd respond if I said that.
sound R13.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Tomoya-kun... you're terrible.
sound R14.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text I was really at a loss as to what to do, you know...
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah, and that was exactly the reaction I wanted to see.
sound R15.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Tomoya-kun, you definitely have strange tastes.
sound R16.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text So you'd rather get a reaction out of me than actually do something dirty with me?
sound R17.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Good to know. I'll remember that.
text She sulks, facing the wall.
text @[Tomoya]
text I'm telling you, it was just a joke.
text I get out of my futon and embrace her from behind.
sound R18.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text You're always joking around, so I never know when something's a joke or not.
text @[Tomoya]
text Whenever I say something you dislike, that's a joke.
sound R19.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text That's awfully convenient.
text @[Tomoya]
text But no, actually, I'm always serious.
sound R1A.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text ...
text @[Tomoya]
text It just makes me incredibly happy whenever I'm close to you.
sound R1B.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text If you word it like that... I won't be able to say no to anything.
text @[Tomoya]
text So is it all right if we stay like this?
sound R1C.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Won't your hand go numb?
text My right arm is underneath her hip, thus being sandwiched by it.
text @[Tomoya]
text Just until it goes numb, then.
sound R1D.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Okay.
text I press the tip of my nose under the collar of her shirt.
text @[Tomoya]
text And if you want me to be perfectly honest, it was the old man I was thinking about.
sound R1E.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text You're thinking about Dad?
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah...
text @[Tomoya]
text I always felt like... he just went around doing whatever he wanted...
